[70.830125, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;109H\u001b[1K\r\n   \u001b[1mResults\u001b[m                        \r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   \u001b[90m┌──────────────┬─────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────────┐\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mservice     \u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mversion\u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mattempts\u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mfailures\u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m \u001b[1mfailure_rate\u001b[m \u001b[90m│\u001b[m                               \u001b[6C     \r\n   \u001b[90m├──────────────┼─────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────────┤\u001b[m                                  \r\n   \u001b[90m│\u001b[m mobile-login \u001b[90m│\u001b[m v4.12.0 \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 844      \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 260      \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 30.8         \u001b[90m│\u001b[m                                 \r\n   \u001b[90m├──────────────┼─────────┼──────────┼────────"]
[70.830142, "o", "──┼──────────────┤\u001b[m                   \r\n   \u001b[90m│\u001b[m mobile-login \u001b[90m│\u001b[m v4.11.3 \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 425,444  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 8,334    \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 2.0\u001b[11;66H\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m├──────────────┼─────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────────┤\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m sso-bridge   \u001b[90m│\u001b[m v2.9.0  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 284,599  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 5,695    \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 2.0\u001b[13;66H\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[3C├──────────────┼─────────┼──────────┼──────────┼──────────────┤\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m web-login    \u001b[90m│\u001b[m v7.3.1  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 710,713  \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 14,330   \u001b[90m│\u001b[m 2.0\u001b[15;66H\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[3C└──────────────┴─────────┴──────────┴──────────┴───────"]
[70.830156, "o", "───────┘\u001b[m           \r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   \u001b[1mMessages and warnings:\u001b[m \u001b[37m jobs status \u001b[m and \u001b[37m jobs show \u001b[m returned none, and no partial-result flag. I only   \r\n   saw the fields those commands print, and I didn't check the job's messages separately.\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n   \u001b[1mWhy it's expensive\u001b[88C\u001b[m┃\r\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n   • \u001b[1mTwo full scans:\u001b[m the main search and the \u001b[37m join \u001b[m subsearch both read \u001b[37m index=* \u001b[m. The same ~1.42M events    ┃\r\r\n     are scanned twice (the job's \u001b[37m eventCount \u001b[m covers both scans, so I can't split it per branch).\u001b[11C┃\r\r\n   • \u001b[1mLate filtering:\u001b[m \u001b[37m sourcetype=\"portal:auth\" \u001b[m is applied in a \u001b[37m | where \u001b[m after the \u001b[37m index=* \u001b[m retrieval, not\r\n     as an early search term, so retrieval isn't narrowed to that sourcetype.\r\n   • \u001b[1mRedundant join:\u001b[m \u001b[37m failures \u001b[m could come from the same pass with \u001b[37m count(eval(result=\"failure\")) \u001b[m. The\r\n     \u001b[37m join \u001b[m only repeats the aggregat"]
[70.830159, "o", "ion.\r\n   • \u001b[1mUnused \u001b[37m eval \u001b[39m:\u001b[m \u001b[37m is_failure \u001b[m is computed but never used.\r\n   • \u001b[1mTime range:\u001b[m no time range is set, so the job runs over whatever default applies. I didn't verify what\r\n     that was.       \u001b[31;31H \r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   \u001b[1mNext:\u001b[m optimize with \u001b[37m saia_generate_spl \u001b[m as specified, run it, and compare runtime, event count, and\r\n   result rows against these numbers.\r\u001b[6B \u001b[1m←\u001b[m open sidebar · Interactive · Manual Approval · \u001b[1m/\u001b[m commands · \u001b[1m?\u001b[m help · \u001b[1mtab\u001b[m next tab\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h"]
