[102.480041, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;36r\u001b[36;1H\r\n\r\n\u001b[r\u001b[24;110H┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\u001b[9B \u001b[34m●\u001b[m Saved \u001b[37m optimized_login_failure_rate.spl2 \u001b[m. I haven't run it yet, so there's no timing co\u001b[18C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m~/payments\r\u001b[4B \u001b[34m●\u001b[40;14H\u001b[m3\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[102.504712, "o", "\u001b]7501;state=done:app=copilot\u001b\\"]
[102.525959, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;4H\u001b[36m| stats count() as attempts,\r\n\u001b[3C    sum(if(result=\"failure\", 1, 0))\u001b[m                                                                   \r\n   \u001b[36m    as failures\u001b[m                                                                       \r\n   \u001b[36m    by service, version\r\n\u001b[3C| eval failure_rate=\r\n\u001b[3C    round(100*failures/attempts, 1)\r\n\u001b[3C| fields service, version, attempts,\u001b[m                                                                  \r\n   \u001b[36m    failures, failure_rate\u001b[m                                                                     \r\n   \u001b[36m| sort -failure_rate\u001b[m                                                                                     \u001b[B\u001b[1K\r\n   SAIA's raw output began with \u001b[37m | @spl2 \u001b[m. I dropped the leading pipe to match the baseline file, since the\r\n   run procedure prefixes \u001b[37m |  \u001b[m.          \r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   \u001b[1mWhat changed\u001b[m                                                                                           \u001b[B  \u001b[1K\r\n   • \u001b[1mInde"]
[102.52598, "o", "x scope:\u001b[m \u001b[37m search index=* \u001b[m became \u001b[37m from index:demo_soc \u001b[m. This is a scope change, not a pure rewrite,\r\n     because the baseline searched every index. It matches the baseline only if all \u001b[37m portal:auth \u001b[m events are\r\n     in \u001b[37m demo_soc \u001b[m, so I'd check that first.\r\n   • \u001b[1mCombined aggregation:\u001b[m \u001b[37m attempts \u001b[m and \u001b[37m failures \u001b[m now come from one \u001b[37m stats \u001b[m pass. \u001b[37m failures \u001b[m is\r\n     \u001b[37m sum(if(result=\"failure\", 1, 0)) \u001b[m.                                                  \u001b[14C     \r\n   • \u001b[1mRemoved branch and join:\u001b[m the second \u001b[37m index=* \u001b[m scan and the \u001b[37m join \u001b[m are gone, so the data is read once\r\n     instead of twice. The \u001b[37m L. \u001b[m/\u001b[37m R. \u001b[m renaming \u001b[37m eval \u001b[m went with them.                                  \r\n   • \u001b[1mDropped \u001b[37m eval \u001b[39m:\u001b[m the unused \u001b[37m is_failure \u001b[m is gone.                                                \r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n   \u001b[1mKept:\u001b[m the same \u001b[37m where sourc"]
[102.525992, "o", "etype \u001b[m, \u001b[37m failure_rate \u001b[m calculation, output fields, and \u001b[37m sort \u001b[m, with no time    ┃\r\r\n   filter added.                                                                                             ┃\r\r\n\r\n   \u001b[1mOpen risk:\u001b[m the \u001b[37m where sourcetype \u001b[m filter is still applied after retrieval, as in the baseline. SAIA      \r\n   didn't move it into the search terms, and I didn't change what it returned.\r\n\u001b[108C\u001b[1K\r\n   Do you want me to run the optimized query now and compare runtime, event count, and result rows against\r\n   the baseline?                                                                           \r\u001b[6B \u001b[1m←\u001b[m open sidebar · Interactive · Manual Approval · \u001b[1m/\u001b[m commands · \u001b[1m?\u001b[m help · \u001b[1mtab\u001b[m next tab\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[103.525992, "o", "\u001b[?25l\r\u001b[A\u001b[33m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\r\n! \u001b[mExecute shell command\r\n\u001b[33m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[40;19HShell\u001b[m \u001b[33m· Manual Approval\u001b[m · \u001b[1m/\u001b[m commands · \u001b[1mtab\u001b[m next tab · \u001b[1mesc\u001b[m exit shell mode\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h"]
