[146.111321, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;37r\u001b[2;1H\u001bM\u001bM\u001bM\u001b[r\u001b[3;110H┃\r\r\n   • \u001b[1mIndex scope:\u001b[m \u001b[37m search index=* \u001b[m became \u001b[37m from index:demo_soc \u001b[m. This is a scope change, not a pure rewrite, ┃\r\r\n\u001b[5Cbecause the baseline searched every index. It matches the baseline only if all \u001b[37m portal:auth \u001b[m events are ┃\r\u001b[29;110H\u001b[37m┃\r\u001b[9B\u001b[m❯\u001b[K\r\n\r\n \u001b[94m●\u001b[m \u001b[94mW\u001b[34morking\u001b[m \u001b[1mctrl+c\u001b[m interrupt                                 \u001b[38;3H\u001b[?25h"]
