[146.144058, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;36r\u001b[36;1H\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[r\u001b[24;110H┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\r\n ❯ Run optimized_login_failure_rate.spl2 as an authorized read-only search job with splunkctl --yes;   00:57 \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[mdo not change Splunk configuration. Detach and poll until it finishes. Show the runtime, event\u001b[12C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[mcount, result count, job messages, and output rows. Compare with the baseline, and do not claim\u001b[11C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[mexact result parity unless the outputs match.\u001b[61C\u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[109C┃\r\r\n\u001b[C\u001b[m~/payments\r\n\r\n❯ \u001b[?25h"]
